{"version": 2, "width": 120, "height": 40, "timestamp": 1791402970, "idle_time_limit": 2, "title": "Cluster93: an agent deploys a queue consumer, a node is killed, nothing is lost", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color", "SHELL": "/bin/bash"}}
[0.0, "o", "$ scripts/demo.sh\r\n"]
[0.022, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.022, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m== Building the server and the CLI\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.24, "o", "   \u001b[32m\u2714 built (17s)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.24, "o", "\r\n"]
[17.24, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m== Starting three nodes, Prometheus and Grafana\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[31.776, "o", "   \u001b[32m\u2714 cluster ready (32s): node1, node2, node3\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[31.776, "o", "\r\n"]
[31.776, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m== An operator creates a tenant and gives the agent a token\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[33.446, "o", "   tenant demo (*) on http://localhost:8081\r\n"]
[33.446, "o", "\r\n"]
[33.446, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m== The agent connects over MCP and looks around\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[33.446, "o", "   \u001b[1m\ud83e\udd16 agent \u2192\u001b[0m initialize\r\n"]
[33.478, "o", "   server: Cluster93 2.0.0\r\n"]
[33.478, "o", "   \u001b[1m\ud83e\udd16 agent \u2192\u001b[0m tools/list\r\n"]
[33.52, "o", "   23 tools: run_job, get_job, job_logs, list_jobs, cancel_job, deploy_service, list_services, service_status, \u2026\r\n"]
[33.52, "o", "\r\n"]
[33.52, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m== The agent deploys a service that works through an order queue\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[33.523, "o", "   \u001b[2m\u2502\u001b[0m export default async (input, ctx) => {\r\n"]
[33.523, "o", "   \u001b[2m\u2502\u001b[0m   const node = (await jobs.get(ctx.jobId)).node;\r\n"]
[33.523, "o", "   \u001b[2m\u2502\u001b[0m   const done = kv.namespace('orders-done');\r\n"]
[33.523, "o", "   \u001b[2m\u2502\u001b[0m   await bus.queue('orders').consume(async (order, { attempt }) => {\r\n"]
[33.523, "o", "   \u001b[2m\u2502\u001b[0m     await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 400));   // the work\r\n"]
[33.523, "o", "   \u001b[2m\u2502\u001b[0m     await done.set(`order-${order.id}`, { node, attempt });\r\n"]
[33.523, "o", "   \u001b[2m\u2502\u001b[0m     await kv.namespace('stats').increment('handled');\r\n"]
[33.523, "o", "   \u001b[2m\u2502\u001b[0m   }, { concurrency: 2 });\r\n"]
[33.523, "o", "   \u001b[2m\u2502\u001b[0m   await ctx.serve(async () => ({ body: { node, handled: await kv.namespace('stats').get('handled') } }));\r\n"]
[33.523, "o", "   \u001b[2m\u2502\u001b[0m   console.log(`orders service running on ${node}`);\r\n"]
[33.523, "o", "   \u001b[2m\u2502\u001b[0m   return ctx.stopRequested;\r\n"]
[33.523, "o", "   \u001b[2m\u2502\u001b[0m };\r\n"]
[33.523, "o", "   \u001b[1m\ud83e\udd16 agent \u2192\u001b[0m deploy_service orders\r\n"]
[35.647, "o", "   hosts: orders--demo.localhost\r\n"]
[37.923, "o", "   \u001b[32m\u2714 orders is RUNNING on \u001b[1mnode1\u001b[0m; the ingress says {\"node\":\"node1\",\"handled\":null}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[37.923, "o", "\r\n"]
[37.923, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m== The agent pushes 120 orders onto the durable queue\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[37.923, "o", "   \u001b[1m\ud83e\udd16 agent \u2192\u001b[0m queue_push \u00d7 120\r\n"]
[42.989, "o", "   QUEUE   READY  IN FLIGHT  DEAD\r\n"]
[44.182, "o", "   orders  96     2          0   \u001b[2m(handled 2 at a time, 400 ms each)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[48.465, "o", "   orders  76     2          0\r\n"]
[48.465, "o", "\r\n"]
[48.465, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m== Chaos: SIGKILL the node running the service (node1)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[48.94, "o", "   \u001b[31m\u2718 node1 killed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[48.941, "o", "   the API and the ingress keep answering on the other nodes (http://localhost:8082)\r\n"]
[48.941, "o", "\r\n"]
[48.941, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m== Recovery\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[52.943, "o", "   +2s  queue: ready  72  in flight 2  dead 0   ingress \u2192 (no answer)\r\n"]
[55.031, "o", "   +6s  queue: ready  72  in flight 2  dead 0   ingress \u2192 (no answer)\r\n"]
[57.131, "o", "   +8s  queue: ready  72  in flight 2  dead 0   ingress \u2192 (no answer)\r\n"]
[59.245, "o", "   +10s  queue: ready  72  in flight 2  dead 0   ingress \u2192 (no answer)\r\n"]
[61.465, "o", "   +13s  queue: ready  66  in flight 4  dead 0   ingress \u2192 node2\r\n"]
[61.465, "o", "   \u001b[32m\u2714 the service restarted on \u001b[1mnode2\u001b[0m 13s after the kill\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[63.573, "o", "   +15s  queue: ready  56  in flight 4  dead 0   ingress \u2192 node2\r\n"]
[65.649, "o", "   +17s  queue: ready  46  in flight 4  dead 0   ingress \u2192 node2\r\n"]
[67.759, "o", "   +19s  queue: ready  36  in flight 4  dead 0   ingress \u2192 node2\r\n"]
[69.905, "o", "   +21s  queue: ready  26  in flight 4  dead 0   ingress \u2192 node2\r\n"]
[72.004, "o", "   +23s  queue: ready  16  in flight 4  dead 0   ingress \u2192 node2\r\n"]
[74.073, "o", "   +25s  queue: ready   6  in flight 4  dead 0   ingress \u2192 node2\r\n"]
[76.177, "o", "   +27s  queue: ready   0  in flight 2  dead 0   ingress \u2192 node2\r\n"]
[78.256, "o", "   +29s  queue: ready   0  in flight 2  dead 0   ingress \u2192 node2\r\n"]
[80.366, "o", "   +32s  queue: ready   0  in flight 0  dead 0   ingress \u2192 node2\r\n"]
[81.124, "o", "   \u001b[32m\u2714 every order handled: 120 of 120 distinct, 32s after the kill\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[81.124, "o", "   \u001b[2mThe orders in flight on node1 came back when their 30 s leases ran out. Delivery is at least once:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[81.124, "o", "   \u001b[2m120 handler runs for 120 orders, so each order is recorded by its id.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[81.124, "o", "\r\n"]
[81.124, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m== Bringing node1 back\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[87.961, "o", "   \u001b[32m\u2714 three nodes again: node1, node2, node3\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[87.967, "o", "\r\n"]
[87.967, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m== Done in 88s\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[87.967, "o", "   Grafana:  http://localhost:3000   (the Cluster93 dashboard: the kill, the restart, the queue draining)\r\n"]
[87.967, "o", "   API:      http://localhost:8082   token: C93_TOKEN=atly_…\r\n"]
[87.967, "o", "   Stop it:  scripts/demo.sh down\r\n"]
